    "en": "Rust gradient face with a hammered surface, a rust pattern and a chamfer bevel, a black keyline and a dark iron band of vertical bars.",
    "ja": "槌目の表面、錆の模様、面取りを持つ錆色グラデーションの面、黒い縁、縦の格子の暗い鉄の帯。"
  },
  "family": "horror",
